\taxon{Remark}
\title{A memory cap does not preserve information}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{transfer-limit}

\p{The bound in \ref{ftip-00DL} controls the number of retained token
positions. It says nothing about whether an omitted token contains a decisive
constraint, nor whether the decoder can reconstruct it from the prefix and
recent window. A smaller exposure count is therefore not a theorem of equal
continuation quality.}
